wanting someone, a longing chain that reaches no one.

808
01:01:35,417 --> 01:01:38,617
i can't be someone else,

809
01:01:38,617 --> 01:01:42,617
despite it all my mind has become my hell

810
01:01:42,617 --> 01:01:46,617
with no escape or hope in the dark

811
01:01:46,617 --> 01:01:49,817
but still in my heart your words echo over and over

812
01:01:50,617 --> 01:01:53,817
暗くなる頃始まるパーティー集める人種は様々
A party starting as it gets dark, various kinds of people gathering,

813
01:01:53,817 --> 01:01:59,617
フラフラするでしょう クラクラ来るでしょう ホロホロとろけそう そうでしょ う flash bang
you'll probably feel unsteady, get dizzy, about to melt away, right? Flash bang!

814
01:02:00,617 --> 01:02:04,617
in this moment maybe it's hopeless

815
01:02:04,617 --> 01:02:09,817
not knowing if i never try

816
01:02:11,117 --> 01:02:17,817
遠い日の夢を見る度 生まれた意味を考えてしまうのさ
Every time I see a dream of distant days, I end up thinking about the meaning of being born.

817
01:02:17,817 --> 01:02:21,117
謳歌 美しい青い日々だな
Oh, beautiful blue days...

818
01:02:21,617 --> 01:02:24,617
we fall, we break,

819
01:02:24,617 --> 01:02:27,617
we drown in fire,

820
01:02:27,617 --> 01:02:30,617
lost inside this dark desire

821
01:02:30,617 --> 01:02:32,817
no love, no faith, just you and i

